[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674270791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3674270791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3674270791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bAOxH","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T09:27:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T09:27:00Z","body":"We're aware of a few shortcoming in DX for XR and working on it but didn't want to hold back release of 4.6 on this.\nIndeed, it's currently recommended to switch back to Vulkan for the time being if you're working on a XR project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674270791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674311645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3674311645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3674311645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bAYvd","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T09:39:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T09:39:49Z","body":"That error sounds like it's a duplicate of #113852 which is fixed in the upcoming 4.6 beta 2, so it might not be related to using XR specifically.\n\nPlease test again once beta 2 is released and let us know if the bug is solved or shows a different error message.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674311645/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676449225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3676449225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3676449225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bIinJ","user":{"login":"funkysandwich","id":56569029,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTY5MDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56569029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich","html_url":"https://github.com/funkysandwich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T20:16:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T20:16:47Z","body":"Testing this on v4.6.beta2.mono.official [551ce8d47] on Windows with SteamVR as the OpenXR runtime, I was unable to reproduce the issue.\n\nBut I also noticed a few issues with the MRP's configuration:\n\n1. In project settings, `xr/shaders/enabled` is true, but `xr/openxr/enabled` is false\n2. there's no script in the scene that enables use_xr for the viewport. It has to be enabled via script in order to have the viewport render to the headset.\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_viewport().use_xr = true;\n```\n\n<img width=\"957\" height=\"562\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0384f972-c67c-4a23-8bae-9fc50634877c\" />\n\nBut after enabling OpenXR and use_xr on the viewport, it seems to render fine.\n\nI added a WorldEnvironment and a cube for the screenshot as it was just rendering the default gray color.\n\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"2089\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1d1866b-48cb-4354-b7e8-d5f9e62b9ff2\" />\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676449225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676595367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3676595367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3676595367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bJGSn","user":{"login":"spacechase0","id":665679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTY3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/665679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0","html_url":"https://github.com/spacechase0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T20:56:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T20:56:11Z","body":"I was fiddling with the MRP after I made it to make sure I understood what I was reporting correctly, so that might be why the setting was like that.\n\nHowever, the \"no script to enable XR\" was accurate to what I experienced, so I didn't add one intentionally since I assumed that would still be a bug.\n\nI'll be testing this on my PC shortly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676595367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691903318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3691903318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3691903318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cDflW","user":{"login":"spacechase0","id":665679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTY3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/665679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0","html_url":"https://github.com/spacechase0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spacechase0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T01:40:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T01:40:46Z","body":"Sorry for the delay in re-testing. I downloaded the project I uploaded here just to make sure I reproduced correctly before.\n\nAfter enabling `xr/openxr/enabled` like I had intended (but not adding any script):\n* In 4.6 beta 1, the issue does exist.\n* In 4.6 beta 2, the issue does not exist.\n\nSo I can confirm that this is fixed for me in 4.6 beta 2.\n\n(I will swap back to Vulkan for my actual project given what BastiaanOlij said, unless it would be useful to give DirectX XR more testing already, since this is just a \"me experimenting with ideas\" project rather than one that would actually be released)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691903318/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3710067927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114134#issuecomment-3710067927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114134","id":3710067927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dIyTX","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T11:34:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T